@saloni.kirpa @sahilbedi.kirpa  Being a realtor isn’t just about selling properties. 🏗️ A big part of the job is visiting project sites regularly, checking construction progress firsthand, understanding what’s changed since the last visit, and verifying every detail ourselves. 
That way, when our clients ask for an update, they don’t get secondhand information, they get an honest, accurate picture of exactly where the project stands, what’s been completed, what’s coming next, and whether everything is moving as promised. 
Because when you’re investing your hard-earned money, you deserve updates based on what we’ve personally seen, not just what we’ve been told. 📍

